  "definition": "Activities Exempt from Visible Emission Standards",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-11-18",
  "historyNote": "#6505-B, eff 5-1-97 (formerly Env-A 1202); ss and moved by #8331, eff 4-23-05 (from Env-A 2003.04); ss by #10416, eff 9-24-13; ss by #13809, eff 11-18-23",
